.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "25 September 2026" "libmyutils v1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words, and characters in a file stream
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <myfilefunctions.h>
.sp
.BI "int wordCount(FILE *" file ", int *" lines ", int *" words ", int *" chars ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR wordCount ()
function reads the file stream
.I file
and computes the total count of lines, words, and characters, returning 0 on success and -1 on failure.
.SH AUTHOR
Annas Sharif (BSDSF24A008)
